### DriveEase Fleet Operations REST API Test Suite

### 1. Owner Login (Success)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/owner/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner12@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. Customer Login (Success)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/customer/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@driveease.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Validation Error: Invalid Email Domain (@yahoo.com) -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/customer/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@yahoo.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe"
}

### 4. Validation Error: Short Password (< 6 chars) -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/customer/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User"
}

### 5. Security Error: Expired / Invalid JWT -> 401/403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer INVALID_EXPIRED_JWT_TOKEN

### 6. Create Valid Booking (Requires Valid Customer Bearer Token)
# @name customerLogin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/customer/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@driveease.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Use accessToken from response above:
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/customer/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "vehicleId": "v-101",
  "startDate": "2026-11-10T09:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-11-14T18:00:00Z",
  "pickupLocation": "Mumbai Central Hub",
  "returnLocation": "Mumbai Central Hub"
}

### 7. Rejected Overlapping Booking -> 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/customer/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "vehicleId": "v-101",
  "startDate": "2026-11-11T10:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z",
  "pickupLocation": "Mumbai Central Hub",
  "returnLocation": "Mumbai Central Hub"
}
